  "title": "GSMTAP: Add the header (up to type) when the dissector table is used",
  "description": "Add the items for the protocol, the version, the header length, and\nthe type to the tree in all cases, including when the dissector table\nis used.\n\nThis prevents having a gap in the dissected bytes (and no gsmtap\nfield or protocol even though gsmtap appears in frame.protocols)\nfor cases like GSMTAP logging packets.",
